  DNS, TKEY and TSIG wire formats and UDP/TCP transport.
  https://github.com/miekg/dns/blob/v1.1.73/LICENSE

Transitive packages keep their notices and licenses in the Go module cache.
No source from MIT Kerberos or BIND is copied or linked; those programs run
as independent processes in the optional interoperability test.
